      ******************************************************************
      * Timestamp work fields. DB2 stores all times as UTC.
      ******************************************************************
       01 EQ-TIMESTAMP-WORK.
          05 EQ-TS-START           PIC X(26).
          05 EQ-TS-END             PIC X(26).
          05 EQ-TS-PICKUP          PIC X(26).
          05 EQ-TS-RETURN          PIC X(26).
